  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency Nutrition Response in Aweil East , Aweil South and Paniyijar ; provision of essential lifesaving integrated primary health services to the vulnerable population through support to 2 PHCC in Aweil East County and 1 PHCC in Koch County;
Scaling up livelihoods protection support to food insecure households (classified in IPC Phase 3 and 4) in Rumbek Center (RC) in Lakes State; and 
Strengthening GBV prevention and response through life-saving services for women and girls affected by conflict in in Panyijiar( Nyal) County</narrative>
  </title>
